<title>UK: Euro jet steady as continent enjoys public holiday.</title>
<headline>Euro jet steady as continent enjoys public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE jet fuel was unchanged on Monday in a notional market.</p>
<p>Public holidays throughout much of Europe eliminated business.</p>
<p>Barges were pegged steady around April IPE +$17.50 fob while cargoes were assessed in the low $20s cif NWE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
